description:
The customer of Particles Global - The USA-based company - (develops AI-powered software for faster, easier, & smarter accounts payable) - is looking for an ML Ops with Python Developer.
About the company: The team is a mixed data and engineering team with 10 people led by the Director of Data and Engineering. They use a modified scrum methodology (2 weeks sprints). The role will involve development, deployment and maintenance of LLMs and ML models on a team with another Data and ML Ops team member (who speaks Ukrainian). They work a flexible schedule, but developers will need to be available at 10am-2pm New York Time (EST).
Requirements:
- Intermediate machine learning knowledge (pandas, numpy, scikit learn, lightgbm, xgboost);
- Python knowledge;
- Fast API framework;
- Experience with ML inference;
- LLM deployment (Langchain, Open AI, Vertex AI, etc);
- Capacity to work independently;
- Good communication skills.
Nice to have:
Kubeflow/Kserve framework for ML;
Ray framework;
Kubernetes knowledge;
Terraform knowledge;
Interview process:
1. Initial 30 minute call with the customer.
2. A short technical assignment.
3. 60 minute final technical call with the customer.
